  "releaseNotes": "v3.3.0\n- Fixed devices not created on first install\n- Oven: on/off now starts/stops programs instead of setting power\n- Oven: Fixed program key lookup to use API-reported keys\n- Oven: Added warnings when setting temp/duration without a program selected\n- Hood: Fixed fan speed control for Option-based hoods\n- Hood: Added FanControl compatibility (medium-low, medium-high, on)\n- Hood: Light brightness 0 now turns off light\n- Hood: Added grease filter alert handler\n- Improved 409 error messages with user-friendly translations\n- Added Actuator capability to all drivers\n- Added clear error message when optional HPM driver is missing",
